            {
              "text": "A landslide event (Ashfell slide) and bench failure damaged infrastructure and disrupted critical services across Withel, <PERSON>, and <PERSON>.",
              "confidence": "confirmed",
              "tweet_ids": [],
              "id": "1a.1"
            },
            {
              "text": "Warnings prompted the evacuation of about 60 households from Withel terraces, alongside evacuations and displacement from Cranmoor and the Ashfell bench.",
              "confidence": "confirmed",
              "tweet_ids": [],
              "id": "1a.2"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mining infrastructure experienced operational disruption at Corvane mine, leading to monitoring of the Corvane tailings dam and policy revisions by Yelverton Minerals.",
              "confidence": "confirmed",
              "tweet_ids": [],
              "id": "1a.3"
            },
            {
              "text": "Recovery efforts successfully restored the lower road and town services, supported by organized community relief.",
